WSGISocketPrefix /var/run/apache2/wsgi
##WSGIRestrictStdout On
WSGIRestrictSignal Off
WSGIPythonOptimize 1
WSGIPassAuthorization On
WSGIDaemonProcess pagure user=_pagure group=_pagure socket-user=www-data maximum-requests=1000 display-name=pagure processes=4 threads=4 inactivity-timeout=300
## It is important that the doc server runs in a different apache process
WSGIDaemonProcess paguredocs user=_pagure group=_pagure socket-user=www-data maximum-requests=1000 display-name=pagure processes=4 threads=4 inactivity-timeout=300

